        {
          "text": "Me a ji m'onwaŋo ondiki nyingi jo, ma Musa kodi Aron jondiko nyingi jo gi kony pa jotel ma Isiraili, cwo apar g'ario, kisi ŋat'acel ocungo ri ot pa kwari mere. ",
