          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji ma Isiraili jobino cokere i kitipin pajo, kisi jacwo i kambi pere gi dwoŋ pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Jolevi jobino cokere thoko tabenakulo ma cikirok, ŋey keme paran okir obin kwoŋ cokirok pa ji ma Isiraili; aka Jolevi jobino bedo jokur ma tabenakulo ma cikirok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.53"
            ]
          }
        },
